{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21941","headline":"宿紫阁山北村 · 白居易","name":"宿紫阁山北村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨游柴阁峰，暮宿山下村。\n村老见余喜，爲余开一尊。\n举杯未及饮，暴卒来入门。\n柴衣挟刀斧，草草十余人。\n夺我席上酒，掣我盘中飧。\n主人退後立，敛手反如宾。\n中庭有奇树，种来三十春。\n主人惜不得，持斧断其根。\n口称采造家，身属神策军。\n主人慎勿语，中尉正承恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}